04:29.100 --> 04:30.260
I was thinking about this recently.

04:30.380 --> 04:33.420
In the UK, we have this state pension thing, which is basically the same.

04:33.420 --> 04:34.900
Like, I'm from a poor background.

04:35.240 --> 04:36.280
Everyone I know is poor.

04:36.480 --> 04:41.380
And all of the older people I know have no pension pot or a very, very small pension pot

04:41.380 --> 04:43.160
