04:48.620 --> 04:52.740
And it's a very weird and new and challenging environment we're going to have to navigate

04:52.740 --> 04:54.120
over the next decade or so.

04:54.280 --> 04:56.360
Over in the world of Bitcoin, six years ago today,

04:56.600 --> 04:59.280
Saylor adopted Bitcoin as its primary treasury reserve.

04:59.540 --> 05:00.560
